{{#> layout title=title page=page}}{{#*inline "content"}}
{{> components/page-header title=title subtitle="Define quality before optimizing cost."}}
{{> components/notice tone="info" title="Explicit launch" message="Preflight is pure and dispatches nothing. Launch requires the exact reviewed frozen specification and shared budget account."}}
<section><h2>Preflight a frozen comparison</h2><form method="post" action="/admin/analysis/evaluations/preflight"><label>Shared budget ID <input name="budget_id" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Idempotency key <input name="idempotency_key" required maxlength="255"></label><label>Frozen experiment JSON <textarea name="spec_json" required rows="16"></textarea></label><button class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" type="submit">Calculate complete matrix</button></form></section>
<div class="sp-analysis-definitions"><h2>The improvement loop</h2>
<ol><li><strong>Observe.</strong> Identify frequent skills, expensive conversations, missing measurements and failure patterns.</li>
<li><strong>Establish a baseline.</strong> Select representative conversations with permission, remove secrets, define success criteria and version the skill, dataset and rubric together.</li>
<li><strong>Compare.</strong> Run controlled experiments with fixed budgets and equivalent cases. Compare quality, failures, latency, tokens and cost per successful outcome.</li>
<li><strong>Review and repeat.</strong> Require human review before adopting a change. Retain the baseline and monitor regressions on new traffic.</li></ol>
<p>Use observed usage to identify a question worth testing, then agree on what success means before comparing changes.</p>
<a class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary" href="/admin/analysis/versions">Inspect the skill baseline</a> <a class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline" href="/admin/analysis/skills">Explore observed skill use</a></div>
<h2>Recorded experiments</h2>
<p>The most recent 100 experiments in your scope. Execution completion alone does not establish quality or complete accounting.</p>
<div class="sp-table"><div class="sp-table__scroll"><table class="sp-table__el sp-analysis-table"><thead><tr><th>Experiment</th><th>Status</th><th>Matrix</th><th>Settled</th><th>Reserved</th><th>Cap</th></tr></thead><tbody>
{{#each experiments}}<tr><td><a href="/admin/analysis/evaluations/{{id}}">{{name}}</a></td><td>{{status}}{{#if frozen}} · budget frozen{{/if}}</td><td>{{cases}} cases × {{variants}} variants × {{repetitions}}</td><td>{{settled}}</td><td>{{reserved}}</td><td>{{cap}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="6">No experiments recorded in your scope. Capture the current skill baseline to prepare a comparison.</td></tr>{{/each}}
</tbody></table></div></div>
{{/inline}}{{/layout}}
